stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> NEW
 NEW --> VALIDATED: permission and consent pass
 NEW --> REJECTED: invalid permission or payload
 VALIDATED --> PERSISTED: encrypted and stored
 PERSISTED --> QUEUED: enqueue
 QUEUED --> WAITING_NETWORK: no allowed network
 WAITING_NETWORK --> QUEUED: network restored
 QUEUED --> RUNNING: constraints pass
 RUNNING --> ACKNOWLEDGED: authenticated ACK
 RUNNING --> WAITING_NETWORK: transient failure
 RUNNING --> FAILED: permanent failure
 QUEUED --> CANCELLED: logout or consent revoked
 WAITING_NETWORK --> CANCELLED: logout or consent revoked
 ACKNOWLEDGED --> [*]
